{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/da138956b93b49fc71da12be4db2ea8e.poster.avif?t=1767311280\" aria-label=\"Exploration\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/da138956b93b49fc71da12be4db2ea8e.webm?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/da138956b93b49fc71da12be4db2ea8e.mp4?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the rusting machine world of DREIFRAME, a challenging pixel-art metroidvania. Play as a Frame, a sword-wielding robot navigating a hostile, interconnected world filled with violent mechanical foes. Fight brutal enemies, exploit their weaknesses, and unlock powerful but risky abilities as you traverse corrupted landscapes and uncover the land\u2019s buried past through skill and persistence.\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/e95aa53bf5d6e7a4440d750a51a6b33c.poster.avif?t=1767311280\" aria-label=\"Combat\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/e95aa53bf5d6e7a4440d750a51a6b33c.webm?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/e95aa53bf5d6e7a4440d750a51a6b33c.mp4?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/bf2cbbc5aeb8c9433f16e12930df15c6.poster.avif?t=1767311280\" aria-label=\"Type based combat\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/bf2cbbc5aeb8c9433f16e12930df15c6.webm?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/bf2cbbc5aeb8c9433f16e12930df15c6.mp4?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, interconnected 2D pixel-art world filled with secrets, hidden paths, and collectibles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face tough enemies and challenging bosses in skillful, demanding confrontations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new abilities to explore the farthest parts of the land and unravel the world\u2019s enigmatic tale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in special type-based combat that enables complex interactions and strategic advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fluid, responsive controls designed for swift movement and intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/1e48bb2b3d14df9ce733b1a8d69d9122.poster.avif?t=1767311280\" aria-label=\"Combat\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/1e48bb2b3d14df9ce733b1a8d69d9122.webm?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3839190/extras/1e48bb2b3d14df9ce733b1a8d69d9122.mp4?t=1767311280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3839190?t=1767311280","background_raw":"htt